From f4451a301072f64fd32a363abb8996037a034a41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craig Shaw <craig@craigshaw.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:50:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Time selected word shifts and local X saves

Preserve high-byte-first writes for selected word ROL/LSR and PHX. Validate word SBC and accumulator ROR, and extend local stack accounting to X0 saves while retaining transfer and join checks.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
